B free space required.\n\n*How To Play\n1. Tap and hold on touchpad to WALK.\n2. Single or Double Tap to SHOOT.\n3. Swipe Up for telescopic ZOOM sight.", "short_description": "Welcome to an unique First Person experience to chase and hunt in a low poly VR Open Season. Don't go easy with the hunting habitat, There's a fair chance you might get Hunted!\nPlease note: ONLY HEADSHOT COUNTS."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.deepbrain.xyz/chase_n_hunt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.deepbrain.xyz/chase_n_hunt", "publisher_name": "Pixelwave", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.deepbrain.xyz/chase_n_hunt", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "SPORTS", "SIMULATION", "SHOOTER"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "304260171682072"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 10, "nodes": [{"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "151529848816157"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "175954596581734"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "173234010084325"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1981524225464179"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "788598307968838"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "346715349330662"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "173096380098630"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1874545192763010"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1585236421530840"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1916257825058822"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1874545192763010"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1513274400, "stat